    "message": "It looks like there were issues with BlockEra Launcher connecting to Microsoft's servers. This is often the result of a poor connection, so we recommend trying again to see if it works. If issues continue to persist, follow the steps in"
  },
  "blockera.ui.b6a5b59cb7ba": {
    "message": "BlockEra Launcher tried to connect to Microsoft / Xbox / Minecraft services, but the remote server rejected the connection. This may indicate that these services are blocked by the hosts file. Please visit"
  },
  "blockera.ui.94f7df82f77c": {
    "message": "It looks like BlockEra Launcher is unable to write to the directory you selected. Please adjust the permissions of the directory and try again or cancel the directory change."
  },
  "blockera.ui.e8609c4f76c6": {
    "message": "It looks like there is not enough space on the disk containing the directory you selected. Please free up some space and try again or cancel the directory change."
  },
  "blockera.ui.471d0f52b386": {
    "message": "BlockEra Launcher is unable to migrate to the new directory you selected. Please contact support for help or cancel the directory change."
  },
  "blockera.ui.81d29ff5cd35": {
    "message": "To play this instance, you must sign in through Microsoft below. If you don't have a Minecraft account, you can purchase the game on the"
  },
  "blockera.ui.efb4051db259": {
    "message": "BlockEra Launcher failed to load correctly. This may be because of a corrupted file, or because the app is missing crucial files."
  },
  "blockera.ui.3a75e1310eef": {
    "message": "and start a chat using the widget in the bottom right and we will be more than happy to assist! Make sure to provide the following debug information to the agent:"
  },
  "blockera.ui.cf1ac793741a": {
    "message": "⚠️ Migration Issue • Important Notice"
  },
  "blockera.ui.b931cddd4a11": {
    "message": "We've detected a problem with our database migration system caused by inconsistent line endings between operating systems (Windows vs. macOS/Linux). This may affect app stability."
  },
  "blockera.ui.617696c8133e": {
    "message": "What’s happening?"
  },
  "blockera.ui.206a57f9baad": {
    "message": "Our migration validator misreads modified migrations when line endings differ (CRLF ↔ LF), which can make the app unusable."
  },
  "blockera.ui.d77989c1e3c0": {
    "message": "Why?"
  },
  "blockera.ui.cea1024f4105": {
    "message": "Git’s automatic line-ending conversions and OS differences can cause these inconsistencies during builds."
  },
  "blockera.ui.bca70bf7a9fa": {
    "message": "What’s next?"
  },
  "blockera.ui.b0afbfcb925b": {
    "message": "We’re working on a permanent fix. In the meantime, you can apply one of the quick fixes below depending on your system."
  },
  "blockera.ui.8a49d2b769ee": {
    "message": "Do I need to apply a fix now?"
  },
  "blockera.ui.590a977f879d": {
    "message": "If you're encountering an error while applying migrations, such as \"Error while applying migrations: migration XXXXXXXXXX was previously applied but has been modified\", or a similar issue with migration, the following actions might help:"
  },
  "blockera.ui.af199f0f220c": {
    "message": "If none of the above steps help, you can try saving a copy of the file"
  },
  "blockera.ui.34847c4c35c4": {
    "message": "to a safe location, such as"
  },
  "blockera.ui.31d066ed215e": {
    "message": "on Windows or"
  },
  "blockera.ui.7c829d26d870": {
    "message": "on macOS, then deleting the original file and letting the app re-create the database file. Note that this may cause data loss inside the app, so make sure to back up your launcher data before applying this fixes."
  },
  "blockera.ui.4a0880ea8254": {
    "message": "Apply fix for Unix like systems (Debian, Ubuntu, macOS and others)"
  },
  "blockera.ui.66d05094e407": {
    "message": "Apply fix for Windows"
  },
  "blockera.ui.964071606403": {
    "message": "✅ The migration fix has been applied successfully. Please restart the launcher and try to log in to the game :)"
  },
  "blockera.ui.cf24c9e25b78": {
    "message": "If the problem persists, please try the other fix."
  },
  "blockera.ui.bab90054367c": {
    "message": "❌ The migration fix failed or had no effect."
  },
